# Challenge directories are verbatim upstream copies and must be tracked as-is.
# The repo-root ignores target Python build output, but the same names carry
# real meaning here: `dist/` is the files handed to players, and several
# challenges ship `.env`, `build/`, or `*.out` artifacts as part of the task.
!dist/
!build/
!*.out
!.env
!.env.*
